Z||000000||Homicidal||06-23-2000||01:46 AM||||I need to go from a headphone jack (walkman size) to some sort of box/terminal that has a set of RCA jacks and a another open spot for a headphone jack (also wakman size).  I want to go from my computer, to my stereo, AND my external PC sub at the same time!  <P>Does this exist?  If not, how would I do this?<P>I run my 7 speakers through my 60 CD Changer which is plugged into the Speaker Out on my comp.  I wanna throw the sub to add more bass to my room.  How would I do this?||||reg||5
